  "body": "There isn't necessarily an error with the config; the problem is with your installation.\r\n\r\nFor example:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/3503f42741d438b67490bc774ee2c3a856f6bc81/synapse/config/tracer.py#L43-L48\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/493c2fc44abcf3457953cc2f6f23509ff7855253/synapse/config/jwt.py#L45-L50\r\n\r\ngrep for `except (ImportError|Dependency).*:\\n.*raise` to find all of these.\r\n\r\nInstead, let `check_requirements` raise a `DependencyException`.",
